UPDATE drive_lists SET notes = '["TIMING: Designer ~10am at the house (est. done 11:30–12). This drive fits the designer day well — City Lights is open until 4pm and Homewise RWC until 6pm, so a noon start works.","SEQUENCE NOTE: The high-end appliance rooms (Davies, CG Daly City) both CLOSE AT 3PM. If seeing those matters more than lighting, flip the order — do appliances first, then City Lights (open till 4). On the designer day the 10am start makes an early appliance run hard, so the default below is Lighting → Homewise RWC (the one appliance stop open late).","DATE CHECK: You said \"tomorrow\" but \"Saturday hours.\" Tomorrow (Sun 7/12) most of these are CLOSED (City Lights closed Sun; Homewise RWC open Sun 10–6). Hours below are SATURDAY. Confirm the actual date and I''ll adjust.","All appliance stops carry panel-ready dishwashers (Bosch/Miele/Thermador) and wall ovens."]' WHERE slug = 'lighting-appliances-designer-day-sf-peninsula' AND notes NOT LIKE '[%';
